# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide demonstrates a minimal working example of the `qiskit-addon-pna` package. We use propagated noise absorption (PNA) to build a noise-mitigating observable. Given a circuit and a Pauli-Lindblad noise model, PNA classically propagates the observable through the inverse noise channel. Measuring the resulting observable on the noisy QPU mitigates the learned gate noise.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng gabay na ito ang isang minimal na gumaganang halimbawa ng package na `qiskit-addon-pna`. Gumagamit tayo ng propagated noise absorption (PNA) para bumuo ng noise-mitigating na observable. Kapag may circuit at Pauli-Lindblad noise model, klasikal na ipinapalaganap ng PNA ang observable sa inverse noise channel. Ang pagsukat sa nagresultang observable sa maingay na QPU ay nagmi-mitigate sa natutunang gate noise.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see how to build a realistic workflow and run on quantum hardware with the [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model), including learning the noise model with `NoiseLearnerV3`, check out the [PNA tutorial](/tutorials/propagated-noise-absorption) on the IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr "Para makita kung paano bumuo ng makatotohanang workflow at tumakbo sa quantum hardware gamit ang [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model), kasama ang pag-aaral ng noise model gamit ang `NoiseLearnerV3`, tingnan ang [PNA tutorial](/tutorials/propagated-noise-absorption) sa IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Prepare the inputs for PNA {#1-prepare-the-inputs-for-pna}"
msgstr "1. Ihanda ang mga input para sa PNA {#1-prepare-the-inputs-for-pna}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "PNA takes as input a circuit, noise model, and observable. Here we build a 10-qubit Trotterized transverse-field Ising model on a 1D chain. We generate a random 2-local Pauli-Lindblad noise model for each entangling gate and embed it as a Qiskit Aer `PauliLindbladError` instruction just before that gate. We choose a weight-4 Pauli-Z observable to measure.\n"
msgstr "Ang PNA ay kumukuha ng circuit, noise model, at observable bilang input. Dito, bumubuo tayo ng 10-qubit na Trotterized transverse-field Ising model sa 1D chain. Gumagawa tayo ng random na 2-local Pauli-Lindblad noise model para sa bawat entangling gate at ine-embed ito bilang Qiskit Aer `PauliLindbladError` instruction bago mismo ang gate na iyon. Pumipili tayo ng weight-4 na Pauli-Z observable na susukatin.\n"

