# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Generate the noise-mitigating observable {#2-generate-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"
msgstr "2. Buuin ang noise-mitigating na observable {#2-generate-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[generate_noise_mitigating_observable](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-pna/qiskit-addon-pna#generate_noise_mitigating_observable) propagates each Pauli generator of the inverse noise channel forward to the end of the circuit. The observable is then back-propagated through the inverse noise channel, returning a new observable $\\tilde{O}$. Three key parameters affect the computation cost:\n"
msgstr "Ang [generate_noise_mitigating_observable](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-pna/qiskit-addon-pna#generate_noise_mitigating_observable) ay nagpapalaganap pasulong ng bawat Pauli generator ng inverse noise channel hanggang sa dulo ng circuit. Pagkatapos, ang observable ay ibinabalik pabalik sa inverse noise channel, na nagbabalik ng bagong observable na $\\tilde{O}$. Tatlong pangunahing parameter ang nakaaapekto sa gastos ng kalkulasyon:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_err_terms`: the number of terms kept in each anti-noise generator as it is propagated forward.\n"
msgstr "`max_err_terms`: ang bilang ng mga term na pinapanatili sa bawat anti-noise generator habang ipinapalaganap ito pasulong.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_obs_terms`: the number of terms kept in $\\tilde{O}$.\n"
msgstr "`max_obs_terms`: ang bilang ng mga term na pinapanatili sa $\\tilde{O}$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`atol`: terms with coefficient magnitude below this threshold are dropped.\n"
msgstr "`atol`: ang mga term na may coefficient magnitude na mas mababa sa threshold na ito ay itinatapon.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For this small, near-Clifford circuit we set the term limits high and use a modest `atol`, so $\\tilde{O}$ stays small and we can measure all of its terms.\n"
msgstr "Para sa maliit at near-Clifford na circuit na ito, itinatakda nating mataas ang mga limitasyon ng term at gumagamit ng katamtamang `atol`, kaya nananatiling maliit ang $\\tilde{O}$ at masusukat natin ang lahat ng term nito.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "***Note: This function uses Python `multiprocessing`. When running as a script, call it inside an `if __name__ == \"__main__\":` guard.***\n"
msgstr "***Tandaan: Gumagamit ang function na ito ng Python `multiprocessing`. Kapag tumatakbo bilang script, tawagin ito sa loob ng guard na `if __name__ == \"__main__\":`.***\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Mitigate gate errors by measuring the noise-mitigating observable {#3-mitigate-gate-errors-by-measuring-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"
msgstr "3. I-mitigate ang mga gate error sa pamamagitan ng pagsukat sa noise-mitigating na observable {#3-mitigate-gate-errors-by-measuring-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we see that the new observable effectively mitigates the gate noise affecting the experiment.\n"
msgstr "Dito makikita natin na epektibong nagmi-mitigate ang bagong observable sa gate noise na nakaaapekto sa eksperimento.\n"

